# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  ⛔ 最重要的一段：window/ 下的运行时数据（含 DSH 认证 cookie，绝不入库）
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# window/webview-data/ 是内嵌浏览器（WebView2）的 profile 目录，其中有：
#   · EBWebView/Default/Network/      → DSH 的认证 cookie
#   · EBWebView/Default/Local Storage/ → 侧边对话 id 与浮窗状态
# 一旦提交上去就是凭据泄露。**这一行不要删。**
window/webview-data/

# 窗口进程的运行时状态（本机路径、几何、欠清标记、本机设置）
window/window-log.txt
window/window-log.1.txt
window/window-log.2.txt
window/window-state.txt
window/clean-pending.txt
window/float-settings.json

# 宿主半写设置时的临时文件（tmp + rename 的中间态）
window/float-settings.json.tmp

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  常规忽略
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ---- 依赖 ----
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/

# ---- 编译中间产物（window/ 的 .exe 与 lib/*.dll 是**有意入库**的，不要忽略）----
work/
*.pdb
*.obj

# ---- 日志 ----
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ---- 环境与密钥 ----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12

# ---- 编辑器 / IDE ----
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.project
.settings/

# ---- 操作系统 ----
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk

# ---- 临时 / 打包产物 ----
tmp/
temp/
*.tgz
*.zip

# ---- DSH 运行时数据 ----
.dsh/
**/sessions/
**/session_projcache/
